ited States. On 20 March 2020, Vapiano announced its cash-flow insolvency due to a sharp drop in sales after most restaurants had to close due to the COVID-19 pandemic."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-vapiano"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vapiano"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Italian cuisine","cuisine/italian-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Pasta Grannies","ref":"site/pastagrannies-substack-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"pastagrannies.substack.com","note":"Vicky Bennison's long-running video series filming Italian grandmothers making regional pasta by hand.","url":"https://pastagrannies.substack.com/p/pasta-grannies-is-now-on-substack","suggested":true},{"name":"Recipes from Italy","ref":"site/recipesfromitaly-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"recipesfromitaly.com","note":"Traditional Italian recipes written by Italian home cooks, organized by region and course.","url":"https://recipesfromitaly.com","suggested":true},{"name":"Manu's Menu","ref":"site/manusmenu-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"manusmenu.com","note":"Italian-born home cook Manuela sharing classic family and regional Italian dishes.","url":"https://www.manusmenu.com/about/about-this-site","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from Italian cuisine","links":[["8½ Otto e Mezzo Bombana","dish/8-otto-e-mezzo-bombana"],["A16 (restaurant)","dish/a16-restaurant"],["Acquacotta","dish/acquacotta"],["Agliata","dish/agliata"],["Agnolotti","dish/agnolotti"],["Alfredo alla Scrofa","dish/alfredo-alla-scrofa"],["Alioto's","dish/alioto-s"],["Amalfi's Italian Restaurant","dish/amalfi-s-italian-restaurant"],["Amato's","dish/amato-s"],["Angelo's Civita Farnese","dish/angelo-s-civita-farnese"],["Antica Pizzeria Port'Alba","dish/antica-pizzeria-port-alba"],["Antico Pizza","dish/antico-pizza"],["Antipasto","dish/antipasto"],["Arancini","dish/arancini"],["ASK Italian","dish/ask-italian"],["Asti (restaurant)","dish